cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you reference this analysis, please cite it as below.
title: "Bun after the Rust rewrite: bug reports, releases, and downloads"
authors:
  - family-names: Smyshliaev
    given-names: Aleksandr
  - family-names: Gulya
    given-names: Ilya
version: "2026.10.30"
date-released: 2026-10-30
url: "https://github.com/IlyaGulya/bun-rust-rewrite-analysis"
abstract: >-
  Updated fork of Aleksandr Smyshliaev's study of Bun's May 2026
  Zig-to-Rust rewrite. It covers reports through 30 October 2026 and npm
  requests through 28 October. It compares daily report types, stated Bun
  versions, releases, closure dates, crashes, and memory leaks. Reports per
  npm request fell after the merge. The data does not establish that Rust
  caused this change. Downloads do not count users, and text matches do
  not confirm defects.
keywords:
  - rust
  - zig
  - bun
  - ai-assisted-development
  - empirical-software-engineering
